<view class="page">
  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">个人信息</view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">昵称</text>
      <input class="input" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="onNickname" placeholder="输入昵称" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">性别</text>
      <picker bindchange="onGenderChange" value="{{genderIndex}}" range="{{genderLabels}}">
        <view class="value">{{genderIndex >= 0 ? genderLabels[genderIndex] : '未设置'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="label">生日</text>
      <picker mode="date" bindchange="onBirthdayChange" value="{{birthday}}">
        <view class="value">{{birthday || '未设置'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <button class="save-btn" bindtap="save" disabled="{{saving}}">{{saving ? '保存中...' : '保存'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-title">安全设置</view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="onChangePassword">
      <text class="label">修改密码</text>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="openCancel">
      <text class="label danger">注销账号</text>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="cancel-mask" wx:if="{{showCancel}}">
  <view class="cancel-notice">
    <view class="notice-title">注销账号须知</view>
    <view class="notice-body">注销后您的账号将无法登录，且：
1. 您发布的内容将按原有可见范围保留；
2. 您的收藏、邀请记录将被保留；
3. 账号信息将被标记注销，无法恢复。

请确认您已了解上述影响。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="cancel-actions">
    <button class="cancel-btn" bindtap="confirmCancel">申请注销</button>
    <button class="cancel-btn secondary" bindtap="closeCancel">再想想</button>
  </view>
</view>
